- seven pages (index/structure/teachers/students/curriculum/reader/classroom)
  wired through school-api-adapter to /api/school
- school-classroom.routes for dashboard/structure/books/reader/classroom
- fix library-search on school-curriculum.html (Cline regression)
- keep catalogue (108) distinct from loaded books; availability from
  verified/file.url; restore immutable /original and serve update/latest apart
- preserve cards-canva mount on server.js
